**Recipe Input**: A form to add recipes by pasting text. Users enter a recipe name or it auto-guesses from the first non-empty line of pasted text. Tags are comma-separated. Recipes save to localStorage automatically.

**Recipe Display**: Cards in a scrollable list showing recipe name, 2-line text preview, and tag chips. Clicking any card opens a modal with the full recipe text, all tags, and a delete button. On first visit, seed with six capybara-specific recipes: Yuzu-Infused Grass Salad, Hot-Spring Veggie Stew, Melon Rind Crunch, Bamboo Shoot Snack Mix, Cucumber Coins, and Sweet Potato Mash—tagged with onsen-night, snack, fancy, grazing, comfort, crunchy.

**Tag Cloud & Filtering**: Display all tags with recipe counts. Users can click tags to filter (AND logic—selecting "snack" and "onsen-night" shows only recipes with both). A search box filters by recipe name, text content, or tags. Show a "Clear" button when filters are active. Display a count line ("3 recipes in the box" or "Showing 2 of 5"). Empty states show 🫙 when the box is empty or 🍽️ when no recipes match filters.

**The Spinner Hero**: A "Spin for Dinner!" button with a 🥘 icon in a prominent hero section. The hero says "Can't decide what's for dinner tonight? Ask the capybara." Clicking the button picks a random recipe from the filtered list (or all recipes if no filters). The button animates through recipe names with easing-out delays, then reveals the winner in a card with "🦫 the capybara has chosen" as the label, the recipe name, tags, and a "peek at the recipe →" link. Confetti falls (🥒 🍈 🥕 🌿 🍠 🎋 ✨). The pot emoji rotates while spinning.

